        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. AFSCME shall submit to the Director – Labor Relations at each campus/hospital/LBNL, thirty (30) days in advance of the leaves requested, the names of the non-probationary career union members at that campus who are eligible for the leave.",
